    "function": "Purine salvage pathway enzyme that catalyzes the transfer of the ribosyl-5-phosphate group from 5-phospho-alpha-D-ribose 1-diphosphate (PRPP) to the N9 position of the 6-oxopurines hypoxanthine and guanine to form the corresponding ribonucleotides IMP (inosine 5'-monophosphate) and GMP (guanosine 5'-monophosphate), with the release of PPi. Thus, specifically recycles hypoxanthine and guanine imported from the external medium, and converts them to IMP and GMP, respectively. Cannot use xanthine as substrate",
